      "writtenOn": "2019-07-16T20:44:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Forgive me if I misunderstand - is this to mean that soong won\u0027t see the dependency between a cc_fuzz target and the statically linked (http://llvm-cs.pcc.me.uk/tools/clang/lib/Driver/ToolChains/CommonArgs.cpp#711) libclang_rt.fuzzer library?\n\nIs this a big problem for static libraries?\n\nAlso, isn\u0027t this \"deferred to clang driver\" already the default behaviour for sanitizer configurations on host (https://cs.corp.google.com/android/build/soong/cc/sanitize.go?rcl\u003dbf5ba930a3aa3dcf5c17c12af0e9337d4130412a\u0026l\u003d512)?",
      "parentUuid": "aacb4364_bb197133",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
